Subject: [RFC PATCH 12/14] hwmon/macsmc: add more types
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 04:52:09 -0400
Message-ID: <20261029085504.3547-13-atharvatiwarilinuxdev@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.55.0
